  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - Certificate of Lawfulness is NOT GRANTED.\r\n\r\nThe London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 30 September 2003, the matter described above is not lawful within the meaning of section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 for the following reasons:\r\n\r\n1.\tThe proposed front porch extension with floor area of 4.06 sq.m, maximum height of 3.0m and being greater than 2.0m distant from the adjoining public highway, as shown on drawings numbered 02 and 03, received by Council on 30 September 2002, exceeds the maximum permitted floor area of 3.0 sq.m.  Therefore, the proposal fails to fall within Class D of Schedule 2 Part 1 of the General Permitted Development Order 1995.  \r\n\r\n2.\tPlanning permission is therefore required for the proposed front porch.\r\n"
  ],
